Summary of Modifications in this Fork:
1. Removed all legacy desktop (Windows, macOS, Linux) and web deployment configurations.
2. Focused development strictly on mobile platforms (Android and iOS).
3. Upgraded Android build targets to modern compileSdk 37, targetSdk 37, AGP 9.1.1, and Gradle 9.3.1 with Java 17 toolchain.
4. Upgraded iOS deployment platform target.
5. Rebranded application identity from Cashew to OpenCashew with package identifier org.opencashew.app.
6. Decoupled upstream Firebase and web endpoint dependencies.
